### ==============================================================================
### DmnController: Standard Static DMN Models (Loan & Insurance)
### Demonstrates: KIE DMN 1.4 Decision Tables (Hit Policy FIRST) and FEEL
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Loan Eligibility: Prime Tier Approved (Low Risk, 6.5% Interest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dmn/loan-eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "APP-100",
  "applicantName": "John Smith",
  "age": 34,
  "monthlyIncome": 75000.0,
  "creditScore": 780,
  "requestedAmount": 200000.0,
  "employmentMonths": 48
}

###

### 2. Loan Eligibility: Underage Applicant (Declined)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dmn/loan-eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "APP-101",
  "applicantName": "Minor Applicant",
  "age": 17,
  "monthlyIncome": 30000.0,
  "creditScore": 720,
  "requestedAmount": 10000.0,
  "employmentMonths": 12
}

###

### 3. Loan Eligibility: Low Credit Score (Declined)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dmn/loan-eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "APP-102",
  "applicantName": "Risk Applicant",
  "age": 29,
  "monthlyIncome": 50000.0,
  "creditScore": 540,
  "requestedAmount": 30000.0,
  "employmentMonths": 24
}

###

### 4. Insurance Pricing: Mature Experienced Driver (Preferred Rate $600)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dmn/insurance-quote
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "driverName": "Sarah Connor",
  "driverAge": 35,
  "accidentCount": 0,
  "vehicleType": "SEDAN"
}

###

### 5. Insurance Pricing: Young Driver with Sports Car (High Risk $2,160)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dmn/insurance-quote
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "driverName": "Peter Parker",
  "driverAge": 22,
  "accidentCount": 1,
  "vehicleType": "SPORTS"
}

###

### 6. Insurance Pricing: Driver with Excessive Accidents (Ineligible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dmn/insurance-quote
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "driverName": "Crash Test",
  "driverAge": 31,
  "accidentCount": 4,
  "vehicleType": "SUV"
}
